In terms of depth, Assistant B provides a slightly more comprehensive response, discussing societal impacts and offering potential alternatives to capital punishment. Both assistive pieces are well-written and provide good insight into their chosen topics, but Assistant B's response is more thorough in assessing the broader implications of the issue and responding to counterarguments.

